    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<i>Fira Mastery Talent created by Wikia user Chellewalker (formally Wikia user Lukewarner).</i><br><br>You treat a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fira\" title=\"Fira\">Fira</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Melee)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Simple Weapon (Melee)\">Simple Weapon (Melee)</a> instead of as an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Melee)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon (Melee)\">Exotic Weapon (Melee)</a>. Additionally, you gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fira\" title=\"Fira\">Fira</a>. This Talent counts as the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Fira)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Focus (Fira)\">Weapon Focus (Fira)</a> feat for the purpose of satisfying prerequisites.<br><br>If you also have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Simple_Weapons)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Focus (Simple Weapons)\">Weapon Focus (Simple Weapons)</a> feat, the attack bonus provided by this Talent does not stack with the attack bonus provided by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Simple_Weapons)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Focus (Simple Weapons)\">Weapon Focus (Simple Weapons)</a>.",
